url: 'https://lilydesignsystem.com/'
abstract: >-
  This repository is the Web Components headless component library: its full achievable scope (456 of the 491 components as of 2026-09-06; the other 35 are permanently excluded by a real architectural limitation), unstyled and accessible.
  It is one subproject of Lily Design System, a free open-source headless
  design system whose canonical catalog of 491 components is implemented
  across seven frameworks. The canonical monorepo is at
  https://github.com/LilyDesignSystem/lily-design-system and this repository is
  published from it as a git subtree.
